    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Give me a little bit"},
    {"type":"note","text":"30 MINUTES LATER"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Can I talk to you about something?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Of course"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"What's on your mind?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"First..."},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"What do you think about this job?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Honestly?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"As long as you're comfortable with it, I'm really happy to do this work with you"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That is really kind of you ❤️"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Thank you"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"But don't you find it strange?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Sending me to spend time with strangers and knowing everything that happens?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"No"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Actually, I prefer it this way"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I can keep an eye on everything and make sure you're safe"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"And honestly, I feel like it brings us closer too"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I'm really happy to share all of this with you"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That touches me more than you think..."},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Which is why I want to be honest with you"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"He kissed me at the end of the date"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I didn't really know what to do"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Then it started raining and I just ran home"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That's why I was soaked when I got back"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Are you okay?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Did he force you?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"No, not at all"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I'm okay"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Then how do you feel about it?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Did you hate it?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Do you want me to warn him or put a note on his account?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"No..."},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"I actually liked it"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That's what makes me feel guilty"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Because of you"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You don't have to feel guilty"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You're an adult"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"You deserve to have your own life as a woman too"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Are you really sure it's okay? 🥺"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Yes"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I'm sure"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I promise"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"That makes me feel relieved 😌"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"It doesn't mean it will happen every time"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"But I already feel less guilty about it"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"You're really sure it doesn't bother you?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"No"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Actually, I want you to tell me whenever something like that happens"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"I need to know because I have to charge the client extra when things go further than planned haha"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"So you really want me to tell you everything?"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"Yes"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"player","text":"It's better that way"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Alright ❤️"},
    {"type":"message","delay":850,"from":"evelyn","text":"Then I'll tell you everything that happens from now on"},
